# Components & Design System

Enterprise Score UI/Components ≥ 9 required.

## Shared Primitives (`components/ui/glass/*`)
- `GlassCard`: Frosted backdrop-blur container with subtle border glow, variants (`default`, `elevated`, `active`, `tinted`)
- `GlassButton`: Tactile push button with tone variants (`emerald`, `amber`, `teal`, `rose`, `ghost`, `glass`)
- `GlassBadge`: Compact pill badge for statuses (`active`, `warning`, `overtime`, `settled`, `kitchen_fired`)
- `GlassTabs`: Pill-style tab bar with active glow pill indicator
- `GlassChips`: Quick-select chips (for 30m, 60m, 90m, socks, table numbers)

## Shell Architecture
- `HeaderTopBar`: Live clock, outlet indicators, quick search (Ctrl+K), audio mute toggle, theme toggle, PIN quick lock button
- `PersonaSwitcher`: Seamless one-tap bottom/top role switcher (Frontdesk Check-in · Play Floor Radar · Cafe & Bar · Restaurant KOT · Cashier Till · Admin & Analytics)
- `PageHeader`: Consistent breadcrumb, title, action slot, and status tag

## Soundscape
- Use non-blocking Web Audio API synthesizer chimes (`lib/audio/sounds.ts`):
  * `playCheckInChime()`: Upbeat harmonic welcome chime
  * `playTimeUpWarning()`: Gentle double-ping reminder
  * `playPaymentDing()`: Crisp cash register coin ding
  * `playKotBell()`: Kitchen order bell
